      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A small round quokka worked in warm brown dk yarn. Just two main pieces, a sphere head and an oval body, make this a perfect beginner project. The quokka's famous smile is embroidered in a curved line, and the small round ears sit on top of the head."
          }
        ]
      },
