      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew the head to the body. Add two small round ears to the head top. Insert safety eyes level with the equator. Embroider the characteristic quokka smile in a gentle upward curve. Sew four small capsule legs to the body base if desired."
          }
        ]
      },
